        {
          "id": "61754464-8c97-41ac-8c8e-037ad3b93620",
          "name": "Get a specific ASHRAE station by name",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get a specific ASHRAE station by name",
            "description": {
              "content": "### GET /ASHRAE/GetStation\n\nReturns the closest ASHRAE station matching the provided name and shortest distance from the specified coordinates.\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `StationName` (query, required): Name of the ASHRAE station to match.\n- `Latitude` (query, required): Latitude coordinate.\n- `Longitude` (query, required): Longitude coordinate.\n- `Version` (query, optional): ASHRAE version (AshraeVersionEnum). Default: Version_2021.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "ASHRAE",
                "GetStation"
